# Automox Operator Module Plan

Status: approved, not yet implemented
Created: 2026-08-15

## Scope

Read-only Automox API surface plus two API write operations behind a
dry-run/`--apply` gate. Credentials keyed by profile. Groovy runtime only,
consistent with the Groovy-only route recorded in `runtime-deferral-plan`.
No Python implementation and no parity tests, per the frozen-Python decision.

Out of scope for this pass: Automox SSH agent operations, batch enrollment,
and the `setup-agents.sh` wrappers.

## 1. Shared contracts

### 1.1 New file: `shared/automox-operator-rules.json`

Non-secret, versioned, single source for both the adapter and reports.

Top-level keys:

- `api_base_url` — default `https://console.automox.com/api`
- `timeouts` — object with `http_seconds` (default 10) and `process_seconds` (default 15)
- `limits` — object with `devices_default` 500, `devices_max` 500, `groups_default` 500, `groups_max` 500, `policies_default` 500, `policies_max` 500, `packages_preview` 30
- `api_paths` — object mapping logical operation to path template with `{}` placeholders: `orgs`, `servers`, `server`, `server_packages`, `server_groups`, `policies`, `policy`, `policy_stats`
- `schedule` — object with `day_bits` (map of bit value to day name: 1 Sun, 2 Mon, 4 Tue, 8 Wed, 16 Thu, 32 Fri, 64 Sat), `week_bits` (weeks 1–5 as 2^(n-1)), `all_months_value` 8190
- `policy_update` — object with `required_fields` (ordered list: `name`, `organization_id`, `policy_type_name`, `configuration`, `schedule_days`, `schedule_weeks_of_month`, `schedule_months`, `schedule_time`, `notes`, `server_groups`), `rename_suffix` `-TMP`, `success_codes` `[200, 204]`
- `device_move` — object with `success_codes` `[200, 204]`
- `unreliable_fields` — list containing `next_remediation`, used to annotate report output
- `default_profile` — `default`

### 1.2 New file: `schemas/automox-operator-report.schema.json`

Modelled on `schemas/jenkins-operator-report.schema.json`.

- `required`: `operation`, `fetched_at`, `status`, `items`
- `operation` enum: `profiles`, `auth-test`, `orgs`, `groups`, `group`, `devices`, `device`, `policies`, `policy`, `policy-stats`, `device-move`, `policy-add-group`
- `status` enum: `ready`, `degraded`, `blocked`, `error`, `unknown` (unchanged)
- `fetched_at`: string, date-time
- Optional string properties: `profile`, `org`, `message`, `query`, `group`, `device`, `policy`
- Optional object property `schedule` with properties `days` (array of string), `weeks_of_month` (array of integer), `time` (string), `use_scheduled_timezone` (boolean), `next_remediation_reliable` (boolean); `additionalProperties` false
- Optional object property `change` with properties `applied` (boolean), `dry_run` (boolean), `from` (string), `to` (string), `steps` (array of object); `additionalProperties` false
- `items`: array of object
- `additionalProperties` false

